  "html": "<article id=\"post-4986\" class=\"container post-4986 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Carolina Heating wins LARP award!</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2018-12-18T16:11:00+00:00\">December 18, 2018</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2026-09-10T20:37:15+00:00\">September 10, 2026</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two Carolina Heating Service technicians smiling as they review items on a laptop\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-smiling-as-they-review-items-on-a-laptop-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina Heating is proud to announce the receipt of the&nbsp;BBB Applause Award for meeting and exceeding advertising standards.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out our reprint of the BBB press release from 12/6/2018:</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">BBB of the Upstate Honored Carolina Heating Service As December Applause Award Winner</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By <a href=\"https://www.bbb.org/en/us/local-bbb/bbb-of-upstate-south-carolina\">BBB of Upstate South Carolina</a> . December 6, 2018.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Better Business Bureau®&nbsp;serving Upstate South Carolina (BBB) awarded <a href=\"https://www.bbb.org/us/sc/piedmont/profile/heating-and-air-conditioning/carolina-heating-service-0673-5001515\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Carolina Heating Service</a> with the BBB Applause Award for meeting and exceeding advertising standards. Each quarter, BBB’s Local Advertising Review Program (LARP) recognizes a business within the 10 counties of the Upstate for adhering to BBB’s Code of Advertising guidelines.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“We at Carolina Heating Service are honored to receive this treasured award,” says Connie Caldwell, General Manager of Carolina Heating Service. “Thank you to the LARP committee, for selecting Carolina Heating Service for such a distinction.”</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Implemented through a local partnership between BBB and the American Advertising Federation of Greenville SC, the LARP committee monitors advertising claims against BBB’s Code of Advertising, a comprehensive set of guidelines established to help businesses plan honest and effective marketing and advertising programs.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The committee explained that transparency in advertising was only part of the reason that Carolina Heating Service was selected for this award. The effort put forth by the company not only to run an ethical business through customer service,&nbsp;but to bolster growth in the Upstate earned them the unanimous nomination for the Applause Award.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">“The primary responsibility for truthful and non-deceptive advertising rests with the advertiser,” said Vee Daniel, president/CEO, Better Business Bureau of the Upstate. “Consumers and businesses should expect honesty in advertising, like that of Carolina Heating Service, and we are pleased to present them with this award.”</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>About BBB</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">BBB is a nonprofit, business-supported organization that sets and upholds high standards for fair and honest business behavior. Most BBB services to consumers are free of charge.&nbsp;BBB provides objective advice, free <a href=\"http://www.bbb.org/search\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BBB Business Profiles</a> on more than 5.3 million companies, 11,000 <a href=\"http://www.bbb.org/search\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">charity reviews</a> , dispute resolution services, alerts and educational information on topics affecting marketplace trust.&nbsp;BBB Serving Upstate, South Carolina was founded in 1983 and serves 10 counties,&nbsp;including Abbeville, Anderson, Cherokee, Greenville, Greenwood, Laurens, Oconee, Pickens, Spartanburg, and Union.&nbsp; Businesses that earn BBB Accreditation contractually agree and adhere to the organization’s high standards of ethical business behavior. BBB is the preeminent resource to turn to for objective, unbiased information on businesses and charities. For more information, visit <a href=\"https://www.bbb.org/en/us/local-bbb/bbb-of-upstate-south-carolina\">bbb.org</a> .</p>\n</blockquote>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--4-up multi-component-container--uniform-height\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-greenville-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An exterior of a building